@model FriendActionResultVm

@*
    Milestone 3.3 — the on-brand status line an HTMX friend write (send / accept / decline) swaps in. The
    message is server-composed and Razor output-encoded. It stays the VISIBLE confirmation; the reliable SR
    announcement is copied into the persistent #friends-status node by Scripts/site.ts (a freshly-inserted
    role="status" is often not announced). tabindex="-1" + data-friend-status-line let site.ts move focus here
    after the swap so keyboard/SR focus is never dropped to <body> (WCAG 2.4.3). No inline JS; CSP untouched.
*@
<p role="status" data-friend-status-line tabindex="-1"
   class="rounded-btn bg-surface-2/60 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink-muted">@Model.Message</p>
